<title>USA: Lucent files patent infringment suit vs Acer.</title>
<headline>Lucent files patent infringment suit vs Acer.</headline>
<dateline>MURRAY HILL, N.J. 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lucent Technologies Inc said Tuesday it filed a patent infringement suit against Acer Inc of Taiwan.</p>
<p>Lucent said the suit charges Acer with violating eight patents relating to semiconductor manufacturing technologies, speech and video coding, and computer display technologies.</p>
<p>The company added the suit affects Acer's desktop and laptop computers.</p>
</text>
